stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idea : You describe a need

    Idea --> Designing : Factory Brain starts designing
    Designing --> Staged : Factory Brain produces<br/>agent package<br/>(agent.json, SYSTEM.md,<br/>permissions.json, tools.json)

    Staged --> UnderReview : You review the draft<br/>via Telegram or Admin UI
    UnderReview --> Rejected : /reject - back to designing
    UnderReview --> Approved : /approve

    Rejected --> Designing : Factory Brain refines

    Approved --> StandardReleased : Factory promotion<br/>validated + human-approved release
    StandardReleased --> Enabled : Factory activates<br/>config/agents/ release definition

    Enabled --> Running : Agent Hub Orchestrator<br/>routes tasks to it
    Enabled --> GraduationReview : Optional later human /<br/>architecture proposal

    GraduationReview --> Enabled : Not justified<br/>remain Factory-owned
    GraduationReview --> ProductRepo : Genuine independent<br/>engineering needs only
    ProductRepo --> IndependentRelease : Specialist repo owns<br/>implementation release
    IndependentRelease --> Enabled : Factory validates + activates<br/>new registry release definition

    Running --> Learning : Agent writes outcomes<br/>to shared knowledge store

    Learning --> Running : Next task benefits<br/>from past learning

    Running --> Improving : Factory Brain reads<br/>agent outcomes,<br/>proposes v2 spec

    Improving --> Staged : New version staged<br/>prior validated release remains available

    Running --> Retired : /delete or superseded by v2

    Retired --> [*]
